    instructionText: Fit piston 2.
    instructionDetail: 'Fit piston 2 into the second cylinder bore.

      1.  Take
      piston 2 from the tray.

      2.  Point the connecting rod down towards the
      crankshaft.

      3.  Slide the piston into the bore and seat the rod on its
      journal.'
